# 旁白 {#narration}

一镜一至两句，按序号先后念；`tools/check-timing.mjs` 保证念得完。

=== media-text {#vo-s01-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
你也许已经用 Agent 串起了即梦和可灵。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s01-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
可分镜表、资产和进度，还散在表格和文件夹里。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s01-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Maybe you already chain Jimeng and Kling with an agent.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s01-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
But the storyboard, the assets and the progress still live in sheets and folders.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s02-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
geml-media 把它们写成几份文本：Agent 读得懂，工具核得了。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s02-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
geml-media keeps them in a few text files that an agent can read and a tool can check.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s03-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
从一页梗概开始。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s03-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Agent 写出角色卡和分镜表：六个镜头，每镜的时长、运镜和台词。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s03-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Start from a one-page synopsis.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s03-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The agent writes the character cards and a storyboard: six shots, each with its length, camera move and line.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s04-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
提示词只写画面，外貌引用角色卡。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s04-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
文档自己说出还差什么：八张图，六句配音。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s04-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Prompts describe the shot and embed the character card.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s04-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The documents themselves say what is missing: eight images, six lines to voice.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s05-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Agent 拿展开好的提示词去出图，这里用的是本机的开源模型。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s05-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
每出一张就登记：模型、种子、提示词。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s05-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The agent takes each expanded prompt to an image model, here an open model running locally.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s05-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Every image is logged with its model, seed and prompt.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s06-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
静图按分镜表的运镜动起来，台词按角色库里的声音配好。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s06-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
待办清零。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s06-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Stills move with the camera direction from the storyboard, and each line gets its character's voice.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s06-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The to-do list is empty.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s07-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
时间线也是文本：每一刀指向一个镜头，
===

=== media-text {#vo-s07-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
配音和中英字幕，都锚在镜头上。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s07-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The timeline is text too: each cut points at a shot,
===

=== media-text {#vo-s07-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
and the voices and both subtitle tracks are anchored to it.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s08-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
一条命令出片，再把中英字幕叠进画面。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s08-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
One command renders it, then the bilingual subtitles are laid over the picture.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s10-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
做到一半断了？
===

=== media-text {#vo-s10-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
重跑只做剩下的，做完的文档都记着。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s10-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Stopped halfway?
===

=== media-text {#vo-s10-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Run it again and only what is left gets done. The documents remember the rest.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s11-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
改一句台词，
===

=== media-text {#vo-s11-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
检查只点名它的配音和用到它的那一段，别的不动。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s11-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Change one line,
===

=== media-text {#vo-s11-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
and the check names only its voice and the cut that uses it. Nothing else moves.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s12-zh-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
你刚看的这一集，和这支片子本身，都是这么做出来的。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s12-zh-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
装上 geml，照着仓库里的例子跑一遍。
===

=== media-text {#vo-s12-en-1 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
The episode you just watched, and this video itself, were made this way.
===

=== media-text {#vo-s12-en-2 .line speaker=concepts.geml#narrator}
Install geml and run the example in the repo.
===

